{"id":534,"slug":"534-zod-integration-voi-react-hook-form-nhu-the-nao","category":"React","subcategory":"Forms & Error","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Zod integration với React Hook Form như thế nào?","question_en":"How do you integrate Zod with React Hook Form?","answer_vi":"Dùng @hookform/resolvers/zod với zodResolver: `const { register, handleSubmit } = useForm({ resolver: zodResolver(schema) })`. Define schema: `const schema = z.object({ email: z.string().email(), age: z.number().min(18) })`. Errors type-safe từ Zod được truyền vào formState.errors. Cách tiếp cận hiện đại nhất cho type-safe forms.","answer_en":"Use @hookform/resolvers/zod with zodResolver: `const { register, handleSubmit } = useForm({ resolver: zodResolver(schema) })`. Define the schema: `const schema = z.object({ email: z.string().email(), age: z.number().min(18) })`. Type-safe errors from Zod flow directly into formState.errors. This is the most modern approach for building fully type-safe forms.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng @hookform/resolvers/zod với zodResolver:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const { register, handleSubmit } = useForm({ resolver: zodResolver(schema) })\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done